#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part4-attention.md:249
msgid "案例一：MNIST 上加 SE 模块"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part4-attention.md:251
msgid "**场景**：MNIST 分类网络（3 层 CNN），你在每层后加了 SE 通道注意力模块。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part4-attention.md:253
#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part4-attention.md:271
#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part4-attention.md:289
#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part4-attention.md:306
msgid "**结果**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part4-attention.md:255
msgid "参数量从 50K 增加到 65K（+30%）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part4-attention.md:256
msgid "准确率从 99.1% 提升到 99.15%（几乎无提升）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part4-attention.md:257
msgid "训练时间增加 20%"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part4-attention.md:259
#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part4-attention.md:277
#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part4-attention.md:294
#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part4-attention.md:311
msgid "**为什么失败**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part4-attention.md:261
msgid "MNIST 是灰度图，只有 1 个输入通道，特征通道本身也很少（8-16 通道）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part4-attention.md:262
msgid "SE 模块学习\"哪个通道重要\"，但通道数太少，选择空间有限"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part4-attention.md:263
msgid "任务太简单，没有复杂特征需要筛选"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part4-attention.md:265
msgid "**教训**：**注意力解决的是\"选择困难\"，不是\"能力不够\"**。如果 baseline 本身就能很好地完成任务，注意力只是徒增计算。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part4-attention.md:267
msgid "案例二：高分辨率特征图用 Self-Attention"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part4-attention.md:269
msgid "**场景**：目标检测网络中，你在 $56\\times56$ 分辨率的特征图上用了标准的 Non-local Self-Attention。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part4-attention.md:273
msgid "训练 batch size 从 8 降到 2（显存不足）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part4-attention.md:274
msgid "推理一张图从 50ms 变成 500ms"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part4-attention.md:275
msgid "mAP 提升 0.3%（几乎不可感知）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part4-attention.md:279
msgid ""
"Self-Attention 复杂度是 $O(H^2 \\times W^2 \\times C)$，对于 $56\\times56$ 就是 "
"$56^4 \\approx 1000$ 万的计算量"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part4-attention.md:280
msgid "高分辨率时空间像素太多，全局关联的计算成本爆炸"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part4-attention.md:281
msgid "大多数关联是局部的，全局计算是浪费"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part4-attention.md:283
msgid ""
"**教训**：**Self-Attention 只适用于低分辨率特征图（$\\leq "
"14\\times14$）**。高分辨率请用局部窗口注意力或直接不用。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part4-attention.md:285
msgid "案例三：所有层都加注意力"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part4-attention.md:287
msgid ""
"**场景**：你在 ResNet-50 的每一层（包括浅层的 $56\\times56$ 和 $28\\times28$）都加了 "
"CBAM（通道+空间注意力）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part4-attention.md:291
msgid "训练不稳定，loss 震荡"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part4-attention.md:292
msgid "最终准确率比不加注意力还低 1%"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part4-attention.md:296
msgid "浅层特征（边缘、纹理）本身就很基础，不需要复杂的注意力筛选"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part4-attention.md:297
msgid "过早的注意力会抑制低级特征的提取"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part4-attention.md:298
msgid "深层才需要注意力来筛选高级语义"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part4-attention.md:300
msgid "**教训**：**注意力应该加在深层，不是每一层**。通常只在最后 1-2 个 stage（分辨率最低的部分）添加。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part4-attention.md:302
msgid "案例四：注意力权重全部趋于相同"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part4-attention.md:304
msgid "**场景**：你训练了一个带 SE 模块的网络，但发现所有样本的 attention weight 都差不多（接近均匀分布）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part4-attention.md:308
msgid "SE 模块没有起到筛选作用"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part4-attention.md:309
msgid "相当于加了一层无用的全连接"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part4-attention.md:313
msgid "可能是学习率太小，注意力没有被充分训练"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part4-attention.md:314
msgid "可能是任务本身不需要通道筛选（如单通道输入的任务）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part4-attention.md:315
msgid "可能是 squeeze 操作的池化方式不对（全局平均池化丢失了重要信息）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part4-attention.md:317
msgid "**教训**：**注意力需要被\"训练出来\"**。如果权重趋于均匀，说明要么超参不对，要么任务本身不适合。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part4-attention.md:319
msgid "决策树：注意力使用指南"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part4-attention.md:338
msgid "**核心原则**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part4-attention.md:340
msgid "注意力是**高级认知功能**，浅层不需要"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part4-attention.md:341
msgid "通道注意力几乎是\"免费\"的，可以默认加上"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part4-attention.md:342
msgid "空间注意力和自注意力有显著代价，只在必要时使用"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part4-attention.md:344
#, python-brace-format
msgid "信息论视角：注意力 = 最大化任务相关{ref}`mutual-information`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part4-attention.md:346
#, python-brace-format
msgid "从信息论来看，注意力解决的是 {ref}`arch-intro` 中讨论的**容量vs信息流**之外的第三个维度：**相关性**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part4-attention.md:348
msgid "网络既要有足够容量（感受野）、信息要能流动（连接），还要懂得**区分有用信息和噪声**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part4-attention.md:350
msgid "通道注意力在通道维度做信息选择，空间注意力在空间维度做信息选择，而长程依赖确保**信息不因距离而丢失**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part4-attention.md:352
msgid ""
"三种注意力协同工作，最大化的是**任务相关的**{ref}`mutual-information` "
"$I(X;Y_{\\text{task}})$——不是保留所有信息，而是保留任务需要的信息。"
msgstr ""

